<section image-layout="blank" id="ryCYWX5sJN"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="OzvTLJ-7kz" background-color="accent" padding="28pt 12pt 24pt" colspan="7"><p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">OWNERSHIP</p><p role="caption">08 / 10</p></grid-item><grid-item id="T6F5vQDvSy" padding="18pt 30pt 24pt 28pt" colspan="53"><labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels><h2 font-size="28pt">Ownership follows outcomes, systems, and continuity</h2><p font-size="16pt">Replace role labels with verified people and deputies before handover acceptance.</p><table col-widths="[20,30,20,30]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding:4pt 8pt; --table-radius:0;"><tr><th colspan="2">Accountability and transfer</th><th colspan="2">Delivery and assurance</th></tr><tr><td background-color="palette-3"><p font-size="15pt"><b>Product Owner</b> · Accountable</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Outcomes, scope, thresholds, launch authority, and D-04.</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>Operations Lead</b> · Responsible</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Training, supervisor readiness, launch coverage, and adoption.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>Incoming Project Manager</b> · Responsible · coordinating</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Integrated plan, RAID record, decision forum, evidence index, and acceptance.</p></td><td background-color="surface"><p font-size="15pt"><b>Data Lead</b> · Responsible · A-06</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Export benchmark, reconciliation, monitoring, and reporting fallback.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>Outgoing Project Manager</b> · Responsible to T+10</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Context transfer, reconciliation, introductions, and historical clarification.</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>Security Reviewer</b> · Consulted</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Production roles, audit controls, and exception review.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>Technical Lead</b> · Responsible</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Configuration, routing, integrations, release execution, and rollback.</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt"><b>Support Supervisors</b> · Consulted · informed</p></td><td><p font-size="15pt">Workflow validation, override use, and frontline feedback.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" background-color="palette-3"><p font-size="15pt"><b>Continuity gate:</b> named deputies for Product Owner, Technical Lead, and Operations Lead; incoming-team access to production and reporting; accepted ownership of every recurring meeting, dashboard, and escalation duty.</p></td></tr></table></grid-item></grid></section>